''The corroboration, with its limit named.'' The founding-then-admit path stands green end-to-end in an
automated witness (9 of 9, 2026-08-04). ''That witness is not this rite'' — it stands no containers, its
sockets stay polite, and no drop actually drops (#rehearse). It corroborates the SHAPE of movements ②
