for its law reports on the proxy'', and the day the two part company it accuses the innocent change.

''THE POINTERS OUTSIDE THE REPO CARRIED A DEAD GENERATION.'' A sweep of the machine's AI-instruction surfaces
found every `lar:` URI in `~/.claude/skills` naming `@lares/v0.1/...` — a path family that stopped existing at
the bags move and had ''dangled silently ever since''. Eighteen URIs, all repointed and each verified against
